{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in the demo:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play the demo as long as you want with the following restrictions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the first 4 heroes: Knight, Archer, Wizard and Rogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level each character until level 25 (you can keep playing when you hit the cap)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mounts are not available in the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first 7 monsters will show up in your village, the rest are waiting for you in the full version!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cute pixel heroes that live on your desktop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idlewood Outpost is an idle desktop pet game where a band of pixel RPG heroes guard your taskbar, collect loot, and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.poster.avif?t=1754369706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.webm?t=1754369706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.mp4?t=1754369706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Idle by Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let the game run while you work, study, or doomscroll. Your heroes will patrol, battle, and level up all on their own \u2014 no punishment, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think of it as a tiny fantasy outpost existing quietly in the corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.poster.avif?t=1754369706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.webm?t=1754369706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.mp4?t=1754369706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Optional Depth, Cozy Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you do feel like checking in, there\u2019s loot to sort, gear to equip, and new heroes to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no penalties or stress \u2014 but you can swoop in at any point and spend some time optimizing equipment so that your Rogue gets braver and your Knight faster... or was it the other way around?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/ce34382b31707816c1b88f5f9c82a933.poster.avif?t=1754369706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/ce34382b31707816c1b88f5f9c82a933.webm?t=1754369706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/ce34382b31707816c1b88f5f9c82a933.mp4?t=1754369706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Desktop Companions with Personality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These aren\u2019t just idle units \u2014 they\u2019re tiny pixel people with thoughts, quirks, and the occasional banter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They might chat about the monsters they\u2019re fighting, celebrate a level-up, or just complain that their boots are wet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.poster.avif?t=1754369706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.webm?t=1754369706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Growing World In Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an evolving game. Planned updates for the full game include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 More  heroes (definitely)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 More mounts (definitely)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Personal housing you can decorate (maybe)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 New biomes for new outposts (probably)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 You let us know what else you want to see!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914120?t=1754369706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914120?t=1754369706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/0312c73fb59e3af3213b86d6dde3d285dde077ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754369706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914120/0312c73fb59e3af3213b86d6dde3d285dde077ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754369706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in the demo:</h2><p cla